      "content": "idk i just feel like i know my body best and i can tell it's just the med settling in. if i just take two of them one night it'll probably just knock the pressure down fast and then i'll be fine for the rest of the week. like, isn't it better to just get the dose working properly if im feeling it this much? it feels safer than just dealing with the dizzy spells all day long. what do u think, would that help settle things down faster?",
